[00:19.22]Jehovah, the Maker of heaven,
[00:23.12]By heaven you can’t be contained,
[00:27.29]Even less an earthly dwelling place.
[00:33.41]But your spirit can here remain.
[00:38.35]Adorning this center of worship
[00:42.37]Are people who walk in your light.
[00:47.69]We rejoice to serve in unity;
[00:52.71]Our devotion is your delight.
[00:57.02](Bridge)
[00:57.17]There is nothing we have
[00:59.85]That you haven’t provided.
[01:07.05]From your own hand, we’ve given
[01:09.66]All that we offer you.
[01:14.95](Chorus)
[01:15.10]For all you have done, we are grateful;
[01:20.72]Our voices in song we now raise.
[01:26.32]For you’ve made our hope reality
[01:30.32]With this place that will bring you praise.
[01:37.54]Jehovah, you knew that we wanted
[01:41.55]A place that will bring to you praise
[01:47.37]And will serve the needs of worshippers,
[01:52.73]Helping others to walk your ways.
[01:57.59]And now may this place serve your purpose.
[02:02.40]There’s work needing yet to be done,
[02:06.64]To pick up the pace and carry on
[02:11.22]In the work given by your Son.
[02:16.09](Bridge)
[02:16.25]So we offer the best
[02:21.56]Of our time and possessions.
[02:25.96]You alone are deserving—
[02:28.80]Giver of all good things.
[02:33.41](Chorus)
[02:33.56]For all you have done, we are grateful;
[02:41.08]Our voices in song we now raise.
[02:46.28]For you’ve made our hope reality
[02:51.22]With this place that will bring you praise.
